            "source": "wiki-matrix-math",
            "origin": "external"
          }
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "EVD-001",
        "VAL-001",
        "VAL-002"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文 [0,229) 给出矩阵定义：\"rectangular array of numbers or other mathematical objects\"（[46,158)）对应\"矩形数组、数或其他对象\"，\"elements or entries arranged in rows and columns\"（[110,157)）对应\"按行和列排布\"，\"usually satisfying certain properties of addition and multiplication\"（[160,229)）对应\"通常满足加法与乘法的特定性质\"。逐字对应、无添加无扭曲。单一来源，无需独立性判定。",
