      "rationale": "claim 分两部分由两段引文分别支持：引文1 \"it would be best to have A stored in row-major order, and B in column-major order.\"（[61,143)）支持\"A 行主序、B 列主序最佳\"；引文2 \"A programmer (or a sophisticated compiler) may use this information to choose between row- or column-major layout for each array.\"（[88,216)）支持\"程序员或编译器可依据扫描顺序选择行/列主序布局\"。两段互补不冲突。独立性：两引文同属 source_id=wiki-array-cs，provenance 均为空对象（无 publisher/derived_from/independence_group），引文本文无转载声明，无法举证来源独立性，故 independence_unknown；同类来源不构成独立佐证，但亦无矛盾。",
